# Crypto Critical
# Manually curated high-confidence exchange routing rules.
# This file is intentionally NOT auto-generated from upstream lists.
#
# Maintenance rules:
# - Prefer DOMAIN-SUFFIX over DOMAIN-KEYWORD.
# - Add only domains attributable to the platform with high confidence.
# - Do not add shared CDN / CAPTCHA / analytics infrastructure just because
#   it appears while an exchange app is running.
# - CoinSpot / Swyftx / Coinbase AU are intentionally excluded from this
#   Taiwan-oriented list and should use an Australia-specific policy/profile.

